# 🚗 Vehicle Rental System

A full-stack **Vehicle Rental System** that allows users to view available vehicles, add new vehicles, and calculate rental costs based on the selected vehicle and rental duration.

## 🌐 Live Demo

**Frontend:** https://vechile-rental-system-ten.vercel.app/

**Backend API:** https://vechile-rental-system.onrender.com/

## 📌 Features

* 🚗 View available vehicles
* 🏍️ Support for different vehicle types such as Cars and Bikes
* ➕ Add new vehicles
* 💰 Calculate rental cost based on number of days
* 💱 Currency selection
* 🔍 Dynamic vehicle listing
* ⚡ REST API communication between frontend and backend
* 🧩 Object-Oriented Programming using Vehicle, Car, and Bike classes
* 📱 Responsive user interface

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Frontend

* React.js
* Vite
* JavaScript (ES6+)
* CSS

### Backend

* Node.js
* Express.js
* JavaScript
* REST API

### Deployment

* Vercel — Frontend
* Render — Backend

